# Lantage — copy to .env.local and fill in what you have, then restart `npm run dev`.
#
# Nothing here is required to start the app. Each capability that is missing is
# reported in the UI with the exact variable to set, and the modules that don't
# need it keep working. There is no demo mode and no sample data — if a key is
# absent, that section of the result is empty and says why.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# VISION — the one key that matters most
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Unlocks LOCATE, INTERIOR and VEHICLE. Resolution order is Anthropic, then
# OpenAI, then Gemini — set whichever you have.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_API_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Works with NO keys at all
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AUTHENTIC — C2PA Content Credentials, EXIF/XMP, JPEG quantization forensics.
#   Entirely offline. No key, ever.
# FACE — local ONNX models (YuNet detect + SFace recognise), weights MIT and
#   Apache-2.0, downloaded once to .lantage-models/. No key, no upload of
#   biometrics anywhere. Strictly a 1:1 compare between two images you supply.
# VEHICLE validation — NHTSA vPIC is free and needs no key. It is what stops the
#   vision model inventing a make or model that doesn't exist.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTIONAL — each adds one capability
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Reverse image search: "has this photo been published anywhere?"
# This is the legitimate route to identifying a specific building — if the
# interior was ever on a listing or rental page, that page names the address.
# Caveat worth knowing: these find copies of YOUR image, not other photos of the
# same room. An original frame nobody ever published will return nothing.
# TINEYE_API_KEY=
# GOOGLE_CLOUD_VISION_API_KEY=

# Statistical AI-generation detection, layered after the deterministic checks.
# Plan around ~82% on in-the-wild media, not the 98% vendors advertise.
# HIVE_API_KEY=

# Geocoding, to turn a region name into coordinates. Self-host only — the public
# Nominatim instance forbids systematic queries.
# NOMINATIM_URL=http://localhost:8080

# Dark basemap. Without it the map falls back to a keyless OpenFreeMap style.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_PMTILES_URL=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Production path only — NOT needed for local testing
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The authenticated /api/search pipeline (audit log, org scoping, Mapillary
# retrieval for street-level precision). The local /api/analyze path needs none
# of it. Never point these at a database holding Criminal Justice Information —
# see docs/MASTER_PLAN.md §7.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
# SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY=
# MODAL_EMBED_URL=
# MODAL_EMBED_TOKEN=
# MAPILLARY_ACCESS_TOKEN=
